    "title": "Dataset for: Monoamine-induced diacylglycerol signaling rapidly accumulates Unc13 in nanoclusters for fast presynaptic potentiation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15629377",
    "publication_date": "2025-06-10",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains the source data underlying main and supplementary figures of Blaum et al., PNAS (2025). The files include data of electrophysiological recordings, live single-molecule imaging data, confocal quantifications, and analysis outputs. Data are organized by figure numbers (e.g., &ldquo;Figure1.zip&rdquo;, &ldquo;Figure S1.zip&rdquo;). For detailed methodology and context, please refer to the associated publication.</p>",
